===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of a group of [[protozoa]]n parasites which are transmitted by biting insects and infect the blood of [[human]]s and other [[vertebrate]]s; order [[Trypanosomatida]] in class [[Kinetoplastea]]
## ''[[Trypanosoma]]'', a genus within [[Trypanosomatida]] whose members are often referred to as trypanosomes
### {{taxlink|Trypanosoma brucei|species}}, a major human pathogen that causes [[sleeping sickness]].
### {{taxlink|Trypanosoma cruzi|species}}, a major human pathogen that causes [[Chagas disease]].
## [[trypomastigote|Trypomastigote]]s, a [[morphological]] class of [[trypanosomatid]]s with a flagellum laterally attached to the cell body.

